{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/9/469bb969c197db37b9ce0010607af27e53a7929f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K=\\sqrt{19+8\\sqrt{3}}-\\sqrt{7+4\\sqrt{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"237\" height=\"32\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/7/8077c124b5f8549195195856310fa951a73830af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 4\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 4\\sqrt{3}\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 12+4\\sqrt{3}\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ -2\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"453\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/7/db7dbf83a57b7a68af8bafc8f2b77da0719689af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19 + 8\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" /> can be written in the form of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/9/3797a9e146c03f4aa534b6f89462080d80dd4bb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b\\sqrt{3})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"21\" />, in order to eliminate the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Square_root\" title=\"Square root\">square root</a>.\n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea4924261fdd47861e06b329e830a476cfbd9963.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19 = a^2 + 3b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/c/b3ceb32ee74bb6e5a890675ee758246a2a862085.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab\\sqrt{3} = 8\\sqrt{3} \\Longrightarrow ab = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"198\" height=\"18\" />, and we quickly find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/b/ccb83850422f77b9f484fb59862cf84bc2003510.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19 + 8\\sqrt{3} = (4+\\sqrt{3})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"173\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Doing the same on the second radical gets us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/f/b4f9f063c7120de00a9118c6f8e119c8cedc9536.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 + \\sqrt{3})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Thus the expression evaluates to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/1/38125630be58bee884c8324a9bf9e934cccf16ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{(4+ \\sqrt{3})^2} - \\sqrt{(2 + \\sqrt{3})^2} = 4 + \\sqrt{3} - 2 - \\sqrt{3} = 2\\ \\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"433\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Pr